OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks scare exotic animals
OL,4,Atoo, keeper says
OL,5,
OL,6,FExotic animals can be as badly affected
OL,7,Fby fireworks as dogs and cats, an
OL,8,Fanimal rescue centre has said.
OL,10,FJamie Mintram, from Ark Wildlife Park
OL,11,Fin Stickney, Lincolnshire, said in one
OL,12,Fincident a wallaby and the joey she was
OL,13,Fcarrying died after apparently becoming
OL,14,Fdistressed by fireworks.
OL,16,FHe urged people considering setting off
OL,17,Ffireworks to be "considerate" and
OL,18,Fattend public displays instead.
OL,23,APub: 20-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,387,380,200,160,0,100
