OL,3,GNEWSAFireworks scare exotic animals
OL,4,Atoo, keeper says
OL,5,
OL,6,F"We have things here like [Arctic]
OL,7,Ffoxes and wild cats, and they're going
OL,8,Fto behave exactly the same way as your
OL,9,Fdomestic dogs and cats. It's pretty
OL,10,Fmuch across the board, most animals
OL,11,Fdon't appreciate fireworks," he added.
